<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Add the bot to your server</h1>

<p class="mb-6 text-sm opacity-70">
  Soundbored runs one shared bot. Invite it to your Discord server, then
  continue to pick the soundboard you want to manage.
</p>

<a href={@invite_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">
  Add the bot to your server
</a>

<p class="mt-6 text-sm">
  <a href={~p"/guilds"}>I've added the bot — continue</a>
</p>
